<title>ITALY: Italian September industrial output falls.</title>
<headline>Italian September industrial output falls.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Statistics Institute ISTAT gave the following provisional figures for industrial production, year-on-year, in September.</p>
<p> INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION	     Sept 96   Aug 96   Sept 95</p>
<p> Production index (unadjusted)     110.8    52.0     114.1</p>
<p> Yr/yr pct change (unadjusted)	-2.9   -11.1	+1.1</p>
<p> Mnth/mnth pct change (adjusted)    +0.4    +0.6	-5.7</p>
<p> Working days in month		    21     21	  21</p>
<p>Note: (The industrial production index was rebased in January 1994 on 1990 levels, replacing a 1985-based index.)</p>
</text>
